198
00:16:37,371 --> 00:16:38,998
Saya dah bangun!

199
00:16:41,458 --> 00:16:42,710
Selamat pagi.

200
00:16:42,793 --> 00:16:44,545
Selamat pagi, Chii.

201
00:16:45,129 --> 00:16:46,880
Kamu nak <i>mochi</i> perasa apa?

202
00:16:46,964 --> 00:16:48,841
Kacang merah? Kicap?

203
00:16:48,924 --> 00:16:51,552
Dia baru bangun, biarlah dia duduk dulu.

204
00:16:56,473 --> 00:16:57,558
Saya makan dulu.

205
00:17:02,855 --> 00:17:06,316
Dalam sup itu
ada banyak sayur yang datuk tanam.

206
00:17:10,904 --> 00:17:13,574
Berselera betul kamu makan, ya.

207
00:17:14,366 --> 00:17:15,951
Sebab sedap.

208
00:17:16,452 --> 00:17:18,078
Oh, ya. Mana ayah?

209
00:17:18,662 --> 00:17:20,497
Dia pergi melawat jiran-jiran.

210
00:17:20,998 --> 00:17:23,083
Dah lama dia tak balik ke sini.

211
00:17:23,876 --> 00:17:26,920
Ceritalah kepada kami tentang kamu pula.

212
00:17:27,004 --> 00:17:28,839
Macam mana dengan bola keranjang?

213
00:17:28,922 --> 00:17:30,090
Pelajaran kamu?

214
00:17:31,341 --> 00:17:33,093
Semuanya saya masih buat.

215
00:17:33,677 --> 00:17:35,262
Dah ada kekasih?

216
00:17:36,013 --> 00:17:40,934
Sayang, budak-budak zaman sekarang
tak suka soalan begitu.

217
00:17:41,018 --> 00:17:43,228
- Awak tak risaukah?
- Aduhai.

218
00:17:47,316 --> 00:17:48,776
Datuk dan nenek

219
00:17:48,859 --> 00:17:51,737
berkenalan di tempat kerja nenek, bukan?

220
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:53,947
<i>Ya, di rumah tumpangan tradisional.</i>

221
00:17:54,031 --> 00:17:58,494
<i>Setiap pagi datuk kamu
datang hantar sayur ke sana.</i>

222
00:17:58,577 --> 00:18:01,580
Bila datuk mula jatuh cinta pada nenek?

223
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:06,835
Datuk-datuk zaman sekarang
tak suka soalan begitu.

224
00:18:06,919 --> 00:18:09,379
Amboi, dia mengelak pula!

225
00:18:10,005 --> 00:18:12,758
Dah lupalah, itu cerita lama.

226
00:18:12,841 --> 00:18:15,969
Datuk kamu malu-malu kucing pula.

227
00:18:18,764 --> 00:18:19,932
Chinatsu.

228
00:18:20,474 --> 00:18:22,351
Lepas makan nanti bersihkan salji.

229
00:18:22,434 --> 00:18:23,894
Okey.

230
00:18:26,396 --> 00:18:29,399
{\an8}2 JANUARI

231
00:18:51,004 --> 00:18:52,923
Saya nak keluar jalan-jalan.

232
00:18:53,507 --> 00:18:55,092
Dalam sejuk-sejuk begini?

233
00:18:55,175 --> 00:18:58,929
Budak itu jenis yang tak suka duduk diam.

234
00:19:12,526 --> 00:19:14,361
Sejuk betul di luar ini.

235
00:19:14,444 --> 00:19:16,822
Kita patut pakai lebih tebal lagi.

236
00:19:16,905 --> 00:19:18,198
Betul juga.

237
00:19:19,449 --> 00:19:21,285
Awak okey?

238
00:19:21,368 --> 00:19:22,619
Saya takkan patah balik.

239
00:19:22,703 --> 00:19:23,954
Jangan jatuh sakit.

240
00:19:42,973 --> 00:19:45,142
Wah, banyaknya salji!

241
00:19:47,311 --> 00:19:49,104
Jom lawan baling salji!

242
00:19:50,772 --> 00:19:53,066
- Beri saya sepuluh saat awal!
- Apa?

243
00:20:20,510 --> 00:20:22,179
Kalau awak sudi, pakailah ini!

244
00:20:26,516 --> 00:20:28,268
Awak sajalah yang hangatkan badan.

245
00:20:28,852 --> 00:20:30,479
<i>Taiki Inomata.</i>

246
00:20:41,907 --> 00:20:44,868
Rajinnya awak, setiap hari bangun awal.

247
00:21:06,890 --> 00:21:08,308
Selamat pagi.

248
00:21:16,858 --> 00:21:18,819
<i>Hari ini pun budak itu ada.</i>

249
00:21:19,820 --> 00:21:21,446
<i>Hari ini pun Taiki datang.</i>

250
00:21:23,073 --> 00:21:24,241
<i>Hari ini juga.</i>

251
00:21:37,170 --> 00:21:39,006
Chii!

252
00:21:39,089 --> 00:21:40,549
Tentang soalan kamu tadi…

253
00:21:41,216 --> 00:21:43,510
Biar nenek yang beritahu kamu.

254
00:21:43,593 --> 00:21:45,053
Soalan tadi?

255
00:21:45,637 --> 00:21:49,224
Apa yang datuk kamu cakap
waktu dia luahkan perasaannya.

256
00:21:51,518 --> 00:21:56,189
{\an8}3 JANUARI

257
00:22:05,657 --> 00:22:07,576
Datuk kamu nampak malu-malu,

258
00:22:07,659 --> 00:22:10,829
tapi dia cakap begini.

259
00:22:14,708 --> 00:22:16,084
<i>"Sedar-sedar saja,</i>

260
00:22:17,169 --> 00:22:18,837
<i>saya dapati</i>

261
00:22:19,504 --> 00:22:22,382
<i>orang pertama yang saya
nak jumpa setiap pagi ialah awak."</i>

262
00:23:48,802 --> 00:23:53,807
{\an8}Terjemahan sari kata oleh Norhazniza Ramli

